{"logId": "11ed39fb-85c3-4075-ba9b-7a652369574b", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "DÍ", "block_bbox": [120, 90, 193, 129], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[120.0, 90.0], [193.0, 90.0], [193.0, 129.0], [120.0, 129.0]]}, {"block_label": "figure_title", "block_content": "盗窃事件的预防及处理方法", "block_bbox": [466, 96, 738, 129], "block_id": 1, "block_order": null, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[466.0, 96.0], [738.0, 96.0], [738.0, 129.0], [466.0, 129.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [192, 180, 422, 339], "block_id": 2, "block_order": null, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[192.0, 180.0], [422.0, 180.0], [422.0, 339.0], [192.0, 339.0]]}, {"block_label": "vision_footnote", "block_content": "家里安装防盗门窗", "block_bbox": [226, 347, 358, 372], "block_id": 3, "block_order": null, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[226.0, 347.0], [358.0, 347.0], [358.0, 372.0], [226.0, 372.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [487, 176, 717, 339], "block_id": 4, "block_order": null, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[487.0, 176.0], [717.0, 176.0], [717.0, 339.0], [487.0, 339.0]]}, {"block_label": "vision_footnote", "block_content": "外出、晚上睡觉前检查门窗是否关好", "block_bbox": [451, 345, 741, 371], "block_id": 5, "block_order": null, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[451.0, 345.0], [741.0, 345.0], [741.0, 371.0], [451.0, 371.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [783, 176, 1011, 339], "block_id": 6, "block_order": null, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[783.0, 176.0], [1011.0, 176.0], [1011.0, 339.0], [783.0, 339.0]]}, {"block_label": "vision_footnote", "block_content": "教育孩子不给陌生人开门", "block_bbox": [782, 346, 981, 371], "block_id": 7, "block_order": null, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[782.0, 346.0], [981.0, 346.0], [981.0, 371.0], [782.0, 371.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [193, 395, 421, 559], "block_id": 8, "block_order": null, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[193.0, 395.0], [421.0, 395.0], [421.0, 559.0], [193.0, 559.0]]}, {"block_label": "vision_footnote", "block_content": "保管好钥匙，丢失及时换锁", "block_bbox": [183, 570, 400, 596], "block_id": 9, "block_order": null, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[183.0, 570.0], [400.0, 570.0], [400.0, 596.0], [183.0, 596.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [488, 395, 717, 559], "block_id": 10, "block_order": null, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[488.0, 395.0], [717.0, 395.0], [717.0, 559.0], [488.0, 559.0]]}, {"block_label": "vision_footnote", "block_content": "晚上贵重物品不要放在客厅", "block_bbox": [488, 569, 681, 592], "block_id": 11, "block_order": null, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[488.0, 569.0], [681.0, 569.0], [681.0, 592.0], [488.0, 592.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [781, 394, 1011, 559], "block_id": 12, "block_order": null, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[781.0, 394.0], [1011.0, 394.0], [1011.0, 559.0], [781.0, 559.0]]}, {"block_label": "vision_footnote", "block_content": "不要在隐蔽的地方放置备用钥匙", "block_bbox": [772, 569, 997, 592], "block_id": 13, "block_order": null, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[772.0, 569.0], [997.0, 569.0], [997.0, 592.0], [772.0, 592.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "DÍ", "block_bbox": [121, 706, 192, 744], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[121.0, 706.0], [192.0, 706.0], [192.0, 744.0], [121.0, 744.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "盗窃事件的预防及处理方法：", "block_bbox": [98, 784, 386, 813], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[98.0, 784.0], [386.0, 784.0], [386.0, 813.0], [98.0, 813.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、家里最好安装防盗门及防盗窗，外出、晚上睡觉前一定要记得检查一下门窗是否已关好，夏天不要因为热不关窗户，以防小偷用杆子或其他工具钩出贵重财物；锁好阳台门窗，防止小偷从管道，围墙爬上来作案；", "block_bbox": [96, 821, 869, 921], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[96.0, 821.0], [869.0, 821.0], [869.0, 921.0], [96.0, 921.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、保管好家里的钥匙，不要给外人及学龄前儿童，钥匙丢失或被偷，要及时换锁；教育小孩，培养防盗意识和习惯，教育小孩不要轻易给陌生人开门，引陌生人进门。", "block_bbox": [96, 928, 862, 993], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[96.0, 928.0], [862.0, 928.0], [862.0, 993.0], [96.0, 993.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、邻里守望，较长时间外出，应请邻居或者物业关照；发现邻居家有可疑的人、事，应主动关心询问；邻里亲友要相互提醒，长期保持自身防范警惕性。", "block_bbox": [96, 999, 870, 1063], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[96.0, 999.0], [870.0, 999.0], [870.0, 1063.0], [96.0, 1063.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、大宗贵重财物切忌存放于家中，最好存放在银行；不要随意在家中设置保险箱，若要设置，应四脚灌注水泥定或者在室内墙固体的暗格之中，并切忌由外人参加暗格的设置安装。若临时需要存放贵重物品，请分散藏放，但请不要放在电视柜、书桌、衣柜、床头柜、床垫底下等部位。", "block_bbox": [95, 1073, 864, 1204], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[95.0, 1073.0], [864.0, 1073.0], [864.0, 1204.0], [95.0, 1204.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、存折、银行卡的密码设置切忌设为生日，并与证件、户口簿分开存放，存折、银行卡", "block_bbox": [96, 1211, 871, 1242], "block_id": 20, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[96.0, 1211.0], [871.0, 1211.0], [871.0, 1242.0], [96.0, 1242.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [882, 869, 1118, 1074], "block_id": 21, "block_order": null, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[882.0, 869.0], [1118.0, 869.0], [1118.0, 1074.0], [882.0, 1074.0]]}, {"block_label": "footer_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [939, 1215, 1122, 1255], "block_id": 22, "block_order": null, "group_id": 22, "block_polygon_points": [[939.0, 1215.0], [1122.0, 1215.0], [1122.0, 1255.0], [939.0, 1255.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.3256753087043762, "coordinate": [120, 90, 193, 129], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[120.0, 90.0], [193.0, 90.0], [193.0, 129.0], [120.0, 129.0]]}, {"cls_id": 7, "label": "figure_title", "score": 0.596964418888092, "coordinate": [466, 96, 738, 129], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[466.0, 96.0], [738.0, 96.0], [738.0, 129.0], [466.0, 129.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9427328109741211, "coordinate": [192, 180, 422, 339], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[192.0, 180.0], [422.0, 180.0], [422.0, 339.0], [192.0, 339.0]]}, {"cls_id": 24, "label": "vision_footnote", "score": 0.7928124070167542, "coordinate": [226, 347, 358, 372], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[226.0, 347.0], [358.0, 347.0], [358.0, 372.0], [226.0, 372.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9505395889282227, "coordinate": [487, 176, 717, 339], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[487.0, 176.0], [717.0, 176.0], [717.0, 339.0], [487.0, 339.0]]}, {"cls_id": 24, "label": "vision_footnote", "score": 0.8394319415092468, "coordinate": [451, 345, 741, 371], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[451.0, 345.0], [741.0, 345.0], [741.0, 371.0], [451.0, 371.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9416480660438538, "coordinate": [783, 176, 1011, 339], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[783.0, 176.0], [1011.0, 176.0], [1011.0, 339.0], [783.0, 339.0]]}, {"cls_id": 24, "label": "vision_footnote", "score": 0.7046846151351929, "coordinate": [782, 346, 981, 371], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[782.0, 346.0], [981.0, 346.0], [981.0, 371.0], [782.0, 371.0]]}, {"cls_id":